# `ALL_SYSTEM` wildcard

- `ALL_SYSTEM` is a **wildcard system code**. A user whose role includes `ALL_SYSTEM` may access **every** system (e.g. `ADMIN_SYSTEM`, `EMPLOYEE_MANAGEMENT_SYSTEM`, …).
- UI checks (`hasModule` / `ModuleGate` / app tiles / sidebar) must treat `ALL_SYSTEM` as full system access — do not require listing each system code when the role already has `ALL_SYSTEM`.
- Specific codes (e.g. `EMPLOYEE_MANAGEMENT_SYSTEM`) are only needed for roles **without** `ALL_SYSTEM`.
